CC   IMGT/LIGM-DB annotation level: by annotators
CC   
CC   for an overview of the musigdjc loci see the first paragraph of
CC   'comment' in musigdjc01. for a summary of the alternative mrna
CC   processing pathways of the c-delta region see the second paragraph
CC   of 'comment' in musigdjc14.
CC       the hinge exon for igd is unusual in that it is longer than any
CC   other hinge exon, and that it encodes no cys residues so no
CC   disulfide bonds can be formed between delta h-chains. this may
CC   account for igd half-molecules. for the other c-delta exons see
CC   musigdjc14, musigdjc16 & musigdjc17.
